          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The great day of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is near — very near and coming fast! That will be a bitter day, for even",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Listen! That terrible day is coming when even.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the bravest soldiers will cry out in despair! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be a day of fury, a day of trouble and distress, a day of ruin and destruction, a day of darkness and gloom, a black and cloudy day, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a day filled with the sound of war trumpets and the battle cry of soldiers attacking fortified cities and high towers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
